# mutabe3 — environment overview (placeholders only; real values never live in the repo)
#
# Backend (Express + Prisma): every variable is listed in packages/backend/.env.example.
#   Production reads /etc/mutabe3/backend.env (systemd EnvironmentFile); local dev uses packages/backend/.env.local.
#
# Frontend (Next 14): see packages/frontend/.env.example.
#   Production build-time values (NEXT_PUBLIC_*) come from /etc/mutabe3/frontend.env, sourced by the deploy before `next build`.
#   Local dev uses packages/frontend/.env.local.
#
# The September 2026 Strapi / Redis / Vercel variables are gone with that plan (brain/DECISIONS.md D-047).
